{"unit_id":"tag:08MP:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是带环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的一阶加厚（first order thickening）。设 <MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003> 是 <MATH_0004>-模（modules）。令 <MATH_0005> 且 <MATH_0006>。设 <MATH_0007> 是 <MATH_0008>-线性（linear）映射（map）。将 <MATH_0009> 提升为 <MATH_0010>-线性（linear）映射（map）<MATH_0011> 的所有提升（lifts）的集合（set），若为非空（nonempty），则是\n<MATH_0012>\n作用下的主齐性空间（principal homogeneous space）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"lifts","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯","context":"加厚的对象。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"平方零加厚。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"给定的模。"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性","context":"模映射的线性。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"所求提升映射。"},{"source_term":"lifts","target_term":"提升","context":"原映射的提升。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"提升的集合。"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空","context":"提升集合的性质。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间","context":"Hom 群作用。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08MP:proof","translation":"这是引理 <REF_0001> 的特殊情形，但我们也给出直接证明。我们有模（modules）的短正合列（short exact sequences）\n<MATHSEG_0001>与<MATHSEG_0002>，\n对于 <MATH_0001> 也类似。由于 <MATH_0002> 的平方为零（square zero），<MATH_0003>-模（module）结构作用在 <MATH_0004> 与 <MATH_0005> 上，且来自唯一的 <MATH_0006>-模（module）结构。由此得到\n<MATHSEG_0003>与<MATHSEG_0004>。\n现在，此引理由正合列（exact sequence）\n<MATH_0007>\n推出，见《同调（Homology）》引理 <REF_0002>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"short exact sequences","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"square zero","target_term":"平方为零"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合列"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"给定的模。"},{"source_term":"short exact sequences","target_term":"短正合列","context":"模的约化序列。"},{"source_term":"square zero","target_term":"平方为零","context":"加厚理想的性质。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"理想及约化模。"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合列","context":"Hom 正合列。"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调","context":"引用章节。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08MQ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是带环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的一阶加厚（first order thickenings）的态射（morphism），如情形 <REF_0001> 所述。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003>-模（module），并令 <MATH_0004>。假设 <MATH_0005> 在 <MATH_0006> 上平坦（flat），且 <MATH_0007> 是加厚（thickenings）的严格（strict）态射（morphism）（定义 <REF_0002>）。则以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0008> 在 <MATH_0009> 上平坦（flat），以及\n<STRUCT_0003> 典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0010>\n是同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n此外，在此情形下，映射（maps）\n<MATH_0011>\n均为同构（isomorphisms）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"加厚"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯","context":"加厚的对象。"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"给定的加厚。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"加厚之间。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"加厚上的模。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"相对结构层的平坦性。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"加厚","context":"严格态射的对象。"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格","context":"加厚态射的性质。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"两个条件。"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"理想张量到理想乘积。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"条件中的映射性质。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","cont