{"unit_id":"tag:08MQ:proof","translation":"映射（map）<MATH_0001> 是满射（surjective），因为 <MATH_0002> 是加厚（thickenings）的严格（strict）态射（morphism）。因此最后的陈述是 (2) 的推论。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n证明 (1) 与 (2) 的等价性（equivalence）。根据定义，在 <MATH_0003> 上的平坦性（flatness）意味着在 <MATH_0004> 上的平坦性（flatness）。对于在 <MATH_0005> 上的平坦性（flatness）也类似。注意，<MATH_0006> 的严格性（strictness）与假设 <MATH_0007> 蕴含\n<MATH_0008>，这是 <MATH_0009> 上的层（sheaves）的等式。此外，注意 <MATH_0010>。因此，(1) 与 (2) 的等价性（equivalence）由《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0001> 推出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"加厚"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"strictness","target_term":"严格性"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"理想层的映射。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"严格性保证。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"加厚","context":"严格态射的对象。"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格","context":"态射性质。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"加厚之间。"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性","context":"条件 (1) 与 (2)。"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"相对结构层的平坦性。"},{"source_term":"strictness","target_term":"严格性","context":"态射的严格性。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"模视作层。"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模","context":"引用章节。"}],"notes":[]}
